    "id": "a2d0f6d5dc72af00fe6b",
    "source": "Ready only: a spell with a casting time of one action to ready instead of an attack. The server casts it now (slot, action, concentration to hold it); when the trigger comes, cast it with its own tool and it is released with the reaction, no second slot.",
