  {
    "id": "22ac76b6d1ff6b8c43af",
    "source": "Ready only: the action the trigger releases, attack (the default) or another. The others are move (up to their speed, released with move_token to the square), dodge, dash, disengage, hide, help, grapple, shove, search, use_object, escape (each released with take_action), item (use_item), stabilize (stabilize) or feature (a class feature that takes an action). For a spell pass `spell` instead.",
    "sourceHash": "22ac76b6d1ff6b8c43afec73bcee38c7d8cc0d603966a20799bde74096c2740d",
    "kinds": [
