    "source": "Record that a combatant is now flying, burrowing or back on foot (Fly spell, wings, Wild Shape into a bird, a burrowing worm). Only a creature with a flying speed takes to the air (the Fly spell cast with cast_buff, wings, a flying form, a stat block's fly); the server refuses the rest. A flying character moves at their flying speed (Fly: 60 feet), and one whose flight ends comes down prone. Flying creatures pass over ground obstacles and are missed by tremorsense; the board draws them lifted.",
